# OpenDsec production inventory, read by opendsecops (docs/OPERATIONS.md).
# One node per line: name, ssh address, private address, roles.
# Roles: iam=<replica id> watcher=<id> apiserver=<index> fleet=<id> edge=<edge id> monitor
# Every IAM replica, watcher, apiserver and edge in the cluster config must
# appear on exactly one node. The ssh address "local" runs the commands on
# this machine without ssh (a single-node cluster, deploy/quickstart.sh).
#
# Example: three control-plane nodes, one per failure domain, and the
# compute nodes running edge (more are added later with opendsecops add-node).
ctl-1     203.0.113.11   10.0.0.11   iam=0 watcher=0 apiserver=0 fleet=0
ctl-2     203.0.113.12   10.0.0.12   iam=1 watcher=1 apiserver=1 fleet=1
ctl-3     203.0.113.13   10.0.0.13   iam=2 watcher=2 apiserver=2 fleet=2 monitor
node-a1   203.0.113.21   10.0.1.21   edge=node-a1
node-b1   203.0.113.22   10.0.1.22   edge=node-b1
node-c1   203.0.113.23   10.0.1.23   edge=node-c1
